      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STOKE AND SMOKE (1) was well supported last time and ran up to expectations, burning early to score a 4.5 lengths win at this track over 300m in 17.11. Well placed and will be tough to beat. POLAR MAGIC (2) has missed the placings at her last couple but was in the money three back when third (17.75) at this track in a Grade 5. Has the ability and expected to do much better. TARAWI FAVORITE (7) is an accomplished sprinter with a great record at the short dashes. Finished fifth latest over 300m at this track (17.51) in a Grade 5. Goes very well at the journey winning two races. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. SIENNA LILLY (3) was a huge winner last start. Big chance on that form.",
